The current rust-rpm-macros install providers under the RPM Version, which
omits Cargo prerelease identifiers. This makes pin-utils 0.1.0-alpha.4
overwrite the source files owned by pin-utils 0.1.0.

2000-Keep-prerelease-Cargo-directories-distinct-in-TakoPack.patch updates
TakoPack's install step and file list to retain the full Cargo version.
Apply it to TakoPack commit 43d3ac3496aad36548da82f2e46bb79f6b59eecb with git am
and build the generator with cargo build --release --locked -p takopack.

Regenerate this provider using the resulting tool:

    takopack cargo pkg pin-utils 0.1.0-alpha.4 --with-spdx --directory OUTPUT
